Small Things Like These is a drama film directed by Tim Mielants.

3
00:17:28,235 --> 00:17:34,235
In 1985, while working as a coal merchant to support his family, Bill Furlong discovers disturbing secrets kept by the local convent and uncovers
truths of his own; forcing him to confront his past and the complicit silence of a small Irish town controlled by the Catholic Church.

