00:58:14,117 --> 00:58:20,117
Small Things like These is a 2024 historical drama film directed by Tim Mielants
and adapted by Enda Walsh from the 2021 novel by Claire Keegan.

11
01:04:03,529 --> 01:04:09,529
It stars Cillian Murphy (who also serves as a producer), Eileen Walsh,
Michelle Fairley, Emily Watson, Clare Dunne, and Helen Behan.

12
01:09:52,941 --> 01:09:58,941
An international co-production between Ireland and Belgium, its plot
focuses on the infamous Magdalene laundries in Ireland.

13
01:15:42,352 --> 01:15:48,352
Small Things like These had its world premiere at the 74th Berlin International Film Festival on 15
February 2024, and was released in Ireland and the United Kingdom on 1 November 2024.

14
01:21:31,764 --> 01:21:37,764
It received positive reviews from critics.

